@startuml 06_alur_kerja_cms_portofolio_admin
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #333333
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBorderColor #CCCCCC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0

title Diagram Alur Lengkap Operasional portofolio-admin (CMS & Dashboard)

actor "Firman (Admin)" as Admin
participant "portofolio-admin\n(Next.js Dashboard UI)" as AdminUI
participant "Auth Guard / Session\n(useAuth Hook)" as AuthGuard
participant "Express REST API\n(Port 5000 /api/*)" as BackendAPI
participant "Upload Handler\n(/api/upload)" as UploadAPI
database "Supabase Cloud\n(PostgreSQL & Storage)" as SupabaseCloud
participant "portofolio-web\n(Website Publik)" as WebApp

== 1. Autentikasi & Validasi Sesi Admin ==
Admin -> AdminUI: Akses URL Dashboard Admin (/admin)
activate AdminUI
AdminUI -> AuthGuard: Cek status token sesi tersimpan di browser
activate AuthGuard

alt Sesi belum ada / token kedaluwarsa
    AuthGuard --> AdminUI: Sesi tidak valid (Unauthenticated)
    AdminUI -> Admin: Tampilkan form login & password input
    Admin -> AdminUI: Masukkan password admin & klik "Login"
    AdminUI -> BackendAPI: POST /api/auth/login {password: "firman2026"}
    activate BackendAPI
    BackendAPI -> BackendAPI: Verifikasi password dengan bcrypt.compare(password, storedHash)
    
    alt Password Salah
        BackendAPI --> AdminUI: HTTP 401 Unauthorized {message: "Password salah"}
        AdminUI --> Admin: Muncul alert merah: "Password admin salah!"
    else Password Benar
        BackendAPI --> AdminUI: HTTP 200 OK {token: "admin_token_xyz", user: {role: "admin"}}
        deactivate BackendAPI
        AdminUI -> AuthGuard: Simpan session token & set status isAuthenticated = true
    end
end

deactivate AuthGuard
AdminUI --> Admin: Render Dashboard Utama dengan Sidebar Modular
deactivate AdminUI

== 2. Pengambilan Data Awal (Dashboard Initialization) ==
AdminUI -> BackendAPI: Paralel Fetch Data Awal:\n- GET /api/profile\n- GET /api/projects\n- GET /api/skills\n- GET /api/experiences\n- GET /api/messages
activate BackendAPI
BackendAPI -> SupabaseCloud: Query tabel projects, skills, experiences, messages, profile
activate SupabaseCloud
SupabaseCloud --> BackendAPI: Return dataset JSON lengkap
deactivate SupabaseCloud
BackendAPI --> AdminUI: HTTP 200 OK (Dataset aktif)
deactivate BackendAPI
AdminUI -> AdminUI: Hitung ringkasan statistik (StatCard) & badge unread messages
AdminUI --> Admin: Tampilkan statistik ringkasan, grafik, dan tabel data

== 3. Manajemen Tab Konten Portofolio (CRUD Operasional) ==

alt A. Pengelolaan Profil & Bio (Tab About)
    Admin -> AdminUI: Edit nama panggilan (shortName), headline, bio & tagline
    Admin -> AdminUI: Klik "Simpan Profil"
    AdminUI -> BackendAPI: PUT /api/profile {name, role, shortName, tagline, bio, ...}
    activate BackendAPI
    BackendAPI -> BackendAPI: Whitelist Sanitasi Kolom (mencegah SQL error)
    BackendAPI -> SupabaseCloud: UPSERT into "profile" WHERE id = 'main'
    activate SupabaseCloud
    SupabaseCloud --> BackendAPI: Status 200 OK
    deactivate SupabaseCloud
    BackendAPI --> AdminUI: {success: true, message: "Profil berhasil diperbarui"}
    deactivate BackendAPI
    AdminUI --> Admin: Toast hijau: "Profil berhasil diperbarui!"

else B. Manajemen Proyek & Upload Media (Tab Projects)
    Admin -> AdminUI: Klik "Tambah Proyek" atau "Edit Proyek"
    Admin -> AdminUI: Unggah file screenshot proyek (PNG/JPG max 10MB)
    AdminUI -> UploadAPI: POST /api/upload (FormData: file)
    activate UploadAPI
    UploadAPI -> SupabaseCloud: Upload gambar ke bucket 'portfolio-assets'
    activate SupabaseCloud
    SupabaseCloud --> UploadAPI: Public URL (https://...supabase.co/.../img.png)
    deactivate SupabaseCloud
    UploadAPI --> AdminUI: {url: "..."}
    deactivate UploadAPI
    Admin -> AdminUI: Isi judul, tech stack, dan Tab "Detail Studi Kasus" (highlights, metrik)
    Admin -> AdminUI: Klik "Simpan Proyek"
    AdminUI -> BackendAPI: POST / PUT /api/projects/:id
    activate BackendAPI
    BackendAPI -> SupabaseCloud: INSERT / UPDATE table "projects"
    activate SupabaseCloud
    SupabaseCloud --> BackendAPI: Status 200 / 201
    deactivate SupabaseCloud
    BackendAPI --> AdminUI: {success: true, data: project}
    deactivate BackendAPI
    AdminUI --> Admin: Toast hijau: "Proyek berhasil disimpan!"

else C. Manajemen Keahlian & Kategori (Tab Skills)
    Admin -> AdminUI: Tambah skill baru atau buat kategori baru
    AdminUI -> BackendAPI: POST /api/skills (atau /api/skills/category)
    activate BackendAPI
    BackendAPI -> SupabaseCloud: INSERT into "skills"
    activate SupabaseCloud
    SupabaseCloud --> BackendAPI: Status 201 Created
    deactivate SupabaseCloud
    BackendAPI --> AdminUI: {success: true, data: skill}
    deactivate BackendAPI
    AdminUI --> Admin: Tabel skills ter-update otomatis

else D. Pengelolaan Pesan Kontak Pengunjung (Tab Messages)
    Admin -> AdminUI: Buka Tab "Pesan Masuk"
    Admin -> AdminUI: Klik pesan untuk membaca isi lengkap
    AdminUI -> BackendAPI: PATCH /api/messages/:id/read {read: true}
    activate BackendAPI
    BackendAPI -> SupabaseCloud: UPDATE messages SET status = 'read' WHERE id = :id
    activate SupabaseCloud
    SupabaseCloud --> BackendAPI: Status 200 OK
    deactivate SupabaseCloud
    BackendAPI --> AdminUI: Status pesan ter-update
    deactivate BackendAPI
    AdminUI -> AdminUI: Kurangi badge notifikasi pesan belum dibaca (-1)
end

== 4. Efek ke Website Publik (Realtime Push) ==
SupabaseCloud -->> WebApp: WebSocket broadcast event (postgres_changes)
WebApp --> WebApp: Re-render komponen tampilan tanpa reload
AdminUI --> Admin: Seluruh perubahan konten live secara otomatis!

@enduml
